ile `CREATE INDEX` is issued in a separate thread, `INSERT` thread will crash a `postgres` process with the failure:\r\n```\r\nts1|pid73116|:14245|http://127.0.0.153:12927 2020-07-02 00:00:15.811 +05 [73158] LOG:  invalidating table cache entry 000030a9000030008000000000004001\r\nts1|pid73116|:14245|http://127.0.0.153:12927 2020-07-02 00:00:15.811 +05 [73158] STATEMENT:  Y*�\r\nts1|pid73116|:14245|http://127.0.0.153:12927 TRAP: FailedAssertion(\"!(portal)\", File: \"../../../../../../src/postgres/src/backend/tcop/postgres.c\", Line: 4057)\r\n```\r\nProcess itself crashes with this stack trace:\r\n```\r\nThread 0 Crashed:: Dispatch queue: com.apple.main-thread\r\n0   libsystem_kernel.dylib        \t0x00007fff7c6812c6 __pthread_kill + 10\r\n1   libsystem_pthread.dylib       \t0x00007fff7c736bf1 pthread_kill + 284\r\n2   libsystem_c.dylib             \t0x00007fff7c5eb6a6 abort + 127\r\n3   postgres                      \t0x000000010c57ac2e ExceptionalCondition + 78\r\n4   postgres                      \t0x000000010c45df38 yb_restart_portal + 408 (postgres.c:4058)\r\n5   postgres                      \t0x000000010c45bcbf PostgresMain + 3055 (postgres.c:4979)\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is a regression introduced by read restart work done in #4254 - we're trying to restart a portal that has been destroyed","closed_by":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.g